Recommends: hostapd, dnsmasq, arping, iw
Description: Adversary-in-the-Middle reverse proxy framework for red teams
 PhantomGate is a precision-engineered AiTM reverse proxy that transparently
 sits between a victim and a real authentication portal (Microsoft 365,
 GitHub, Google, etc.). It captures credentials, intercepts MFA tokens,
 and steals authenticated session cookies in real-time.
 .
 Features include YAML-based phishlet system, real-time operator dashboard,
 ARP+DNS poisoning for LAN interception, rogue AP creation, dynamic CA
 certificate generation, and captive portal for CA distribution.
 .
 WARNING: This tool is designed exclusively for authorized penetration
 testing and Red Team engagements.
